    "against v4's real schema before the rows were written, never read off the source:",
    "the two `.default().optional()` fields still default, unknown keys are stripped,",
    "`null` refuses everywhere Zod's `.optional()` admits only `undefined`, string",
    "bounds count UTF-16 units, and llmNumber's Number() grammar accepts \"0x3\"/\"1e1\"",
    "while `.int()`/min/max still judge the converted value. Refusals write NOTHING and",
    "answer ONE fixed error pair whatever field failed."
  ],
